            "review_title": "Review at Huong Viet Restaurant",
            "review_text": "oldsalt55\nCastlegar, Canada48 contributions\n0\nThe best Ban Xeo in Nha Trang\nMar 2016\nI don't know if I spelled it right but the Ban Xeo (Vietnamese style pancakes) in this place are the best. They serve the large Saigon style ones. Most places serve the small ones with the whole small squid in them. Anyhow, they have a pretty good menu of Vietnamese and American foods and even have some Chinese style dim sum. They're prices are very reasonable. I recommend this place for sure.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 20, 2016",
