            "review_title": "Review at Huong Viet Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Owee\nNha Trang, Vietnam7621 contributions\n0\nQuality food, Clean, and good value\nApr 2016 • Solo\nFinally I have found a place that I look forward to going on the nights I cannot get home cooking. This restaurant is amongst the cleanest I have visited and have a good variety of choices for everybody at excellent prices. I have had a number of entrees including the Ribeye steak Platter (only 175000) and everything has been very good and portions generous. I think it is becoming my favorite eatery in Nha Trang.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 8, 2016",
